---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
import SupportBox from "../../components/SupportBox.astro";
import { site } from "../../lib/ui";
---

<Layout locale="en" title="About · HKP4" nav="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>About HKP4</h1>
      <p class="sub">關於 HKP4 — 以事實與邏輯深讀香港</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose" style="max-width:44rem">
      <h2>What HKP4 is</h2>
      <p>
        HKP4 stands for four lenses on the city: <strong>Prosperity 繁榮</strong>,
        <strong>Projection 推演</strong>, <strong>Prospect 前景</strong> and
        <strong>Potential 潛能</strong>. This journal publishes regular commentary on
        Hong Kong's development through these four lenses, with every article appearing
        in both Traditional Chinese and English.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we are anonymous</h2>
      <p>
        This site is run anonymously as "The HKP4 Desk". We believe opinions on public
        affairs should be judged on their content, not on the identity, profession or
        interests of the speaker. Anonymity is also a discipline: we are allowed no
        authority except that of the argument.
      </p>
      <p>
        One boundary we owe readers honestly: the site is anonymous to <em>readers</em>,
        not to its infrastructure — GitHub and Patreon know who runs it, as any platform
        that lawfully handles money must. The rule we keep is that nothing published
        ever references the private identity, and the private identity never references this site.
      </p>

      <h2>Authorship &amp; reuse</h2>
      <p>
        Written in spare time by one author, unaffiliated with any institution, and
        accepting no funding that comes attached to a viewpoint. Articles may be freely
        reposted with attribution and full text intact.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Tips, critiques and submissions: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
        (please do not ask us to verify our identity).
      </p>

      <SupportBox locale="en" />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
